(
    title: "Demolition Herby",
    developer: Some("Don Ruffcorn"),
    description: Some("Herby drives the white lines of a grid, painting them red — box in all four sides of a square and it blacks out for points and fuel. Three chase cars re-paint your lines white and try to ram you off the track; rear-ending them first bounces them away for bonus points, and the button shifts into a fuel-hungry overdrive. A second joystick hands an opponent control of the chase cars themselves."),
